{"fps": 30, "total": 32.135242500000004, "hash": "f85fe029e4392cb2", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "b01", "text": "What if your phone took one dollar every time you checked it?", "start": 0.054000000000000006, "end": 2.4189999999999996, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 0.054000000000000006, "end": 0.22700000000000004}, {"text": "if", "start": 0.24599999999999997, "end": 0.35000000000000003}, {"text": "your", "start": 0.36100000000000004, "end": 0.534}, {"text": "phone", "start": 0.5529999999999999, "end": 0.7600000000000001}, {"text": "took", "start": 0.7830000000000001, "end": 0.9560000000000001}, {"text": "one", "start": 0.975, "end": 1.113}, {"text": "dollar", "start": 1.129, "end": 1.371}, {"text": "every", "start": 1.398, "end": 1.605}, {"text": "time", "start": 1.6279999999999997, "end": 1.8009999999999997}, {"text": "you", "start": 1.82, "end": 1.9579999999999997}, {"text": "checked", "start": 1.973, "end": 2.25}, {"text": "it?", "start": 2.2800000000000002, "end": 2.4189999999999996}]}, {"id": "b02", "text": "Because you would be broke before lunch.", "start": 2.776, "end": 4.336, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 2.776, "end": 3.0559999999999996}, {"text": "you", "start": 3.0559999999999996, "end": 3.336}, {"text": "would", "start": 3.336, "end": 3.456}, {"text": "be", "start": 3.456, "end": 3.576}, {"text": "broke", "start": 3.576, "end": 3.776}, {"text": "before", "start": 3.776, "end": 4.056}, {"text": "lunch.", "start": 4.056, "end": 4.336}]}, {"id": "b03", "text": "The average American checks their phone ninety six times a day.", "start": 4.924, "end": 7.226, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 4.924, "end": 5.054}, {"text": "average", "start": 5.069, "end": 5.33}, {"text": "American", "start": 5.359, "end": 5.6530000000000005}, {"text": "checks", "start": 5.6850000000000005, "end": 5.914000000000001}, {"text": "their", "start": 5.939000000000001, "end": 6.135}, {"text": "phone", "start": 6.156000000000001, "end": 6.352}, {"text": "ninety", "start": 6.3740000000000006, "end": 6.602}, {"text": "six", "start": 6.628, "end": 6.758}, {"text": "times", "start": 6.773000000000001, "end": 6.968}, {"text": "a", "start": 6.99, "end": 7.055000000000001}, {"text": "day.", "start": 7.0630000000000015, "end": 7.226}]}, {"id": "b04", "text": "That is once every ten minutes you are awake.", "start": 7.762000000000001, "end": 9.542000000000002, "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 7.762000000000001, "end": 7.922000000000001}, {"text": "is", "start": 7.922000000000001, "end": 8.022}, {"text": "once", "start": 8.022, "end": 8.182}, {"text": "every", "start": 8.182, "end": 8.482}, {"text": "ten", "start": 8.482, "end": 8.742}, {"text": "minutes", "start": 8.742, "end": 8.962}, {"text": "you", "start": 8.962, "end": 9.182}, {"text": "are", "start": 9.182, "end": 9.302}, {"text": "awake.", "start": 9.302, "end": 9.542000000000002}]}, {"id": "b05", "text": "So that is ninety six dollars a day just to look at a screen.", "start": 9.949, "end": 12.654000000000002, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 9.949, "end": 10.068}, {"text": "that", "start": 10.082, "end": 10.28}, {"text": "is", "start": 10.303, "end": 10.422}, {"text": "ninety", "start": 10.435, "end": 10.714000000000002}, {"text": "six", "start": 10.744, "end": 10.904000000000002}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 10.921, "end": 11.239}, {"text": "a", "start": 11.275, "end": 11.354000000000001}, {"text": "day", "start": 11.363, "end": 11.522}, {"text": "just", "start": 11.540000000000001, "end": 11.739000000000003}, {"text": "to", "start": 11.761000000000003, "end": 11.88}, {"text": "look", "start": 11.894, "end": 12.092}, {"text": "at", "start": 12.114, "end": 12.234}, {"text": "a", "start": 12.247, "end": 12.327}, {"text": "screen.", "start": 12.335, "end": 12.654000000000002}]}, {"id": "b06", "text": "And by the end of the year it is thirty five thousand dollars.", "start": 13.243, "end": 15.885, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 13.243, "end": 13.396}, {"text": "by", "st