ch.", "start": 21.251, "end": 21.450999999999997}]}, {"id": "b09", "text": "So you would pay seventy thousand dollars a year.", "start": 22.042, "end": 24.116999999999997, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 22.042, "end": 22.154999999999998}, {"text": "you", "start": 22.167999999999996, "end": 22.319}, {"text": "would", "start": 22.335999999999995, "end": 22.562999999999995}, {"text": "pay", "start": 22.588, "end": 22.738999999999997}, {"text": "seventy", "start": 22.755999999999997, "end": 23.058}, {"text": "thousand", "start": 23.091999999999995, "end": 23.432}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 23.47, "end": 23.771999999999995}, {"text": "a", "start": 23.806, "end": 23.881999999999998}, {"text": "year.", "start": 23.889999999999997, "end": 24.116999999999997}]}, {"id": "b10", "text": "And the scary part is you would still keep checking it.", "start": 24.634999999999998, "end": 26.774999999999995, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 24.634999999999998, "end": 24.735}, {"text": "the", "start": 24.735, "end": 24.795}, {"text": "scary", "start": 24.795, "end": 24.934999999999995}, {"text": "part", "start": 24.934999999999995, "end": 25.234999999999996}, {"text": "is", "start": 25.234999999999996, "end": 25.495}, {"text": "you", "start": 25.654999999999998, "end": 25.835}, {"text": "would", "start": 25.835, "end": 25.935}, {"text": "still", "start": 25.935, "end": 26.135}, {"text": "keep", "start": 26.135, "end": 26.295}, {"text": "checking", "start": 26.295, "end": 26.615}, {"text": "it.", "start": 26.615, "end": 26.774999999999995}]}, {"id": "b11", "text": "Because the phone was never free and you already pay with your time.", "start": 27.1, "end": 29.679999999999996, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 27.1, "end": 27.279999999999998}, {"text": "the", "start": 27.279999999999998, "end": 27.4}, {"text": "phone", "start": 27.4, "end": 27.519999999999996}, {"text": "was", "start": 27.519999999999996, "end": 27.7}, {"text": "never", "start": 27.7, "end": 27.899999999999995}, {"text": "free", "start": 27.899999999999995, "end": 28.2}, {"text": "and", "start": 28.2, "end": 28.559999999999995}, {"text": "you", "start": 28.559999999999995, "end": 28.639999999999997}, {"text": "already", "start": 28.639999999999997, "end": 28.88}, {"text": "pay", "start": 28.88, "end": 29.159999999999997}, {"text": "with", "start": 29.159999999999997, "end": 29.32}, {"text": "your", "start": 29.32, "end": 29.439999999999998}, {"text": "time.", "start": 29.439999999999998, "end": 29.679999999999996}]}, {"id": "b12", "text": "So next time you pick it up just ask yourself", "start": 30.093, "end": 31.853, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 30.093, "end": 30.213}, {"text": "next", "start": 30.213, "end": 30.373}, {"text": "time", "start": 30.373, "end": 30.613}, {"text": "you", "start": 30.613, "end": 30.733}, {"text": "pick", "start": 30.733, "end": 30.852999999999998}, {"text": "it", "start": 30.852999999999998, "end": 30.973}, {"text": "up", "start": 30.973, "end": 31.092999999999996}, {"text": "just", "start": 31.292999999999996, "end": 31.392999999999997}, {"text": "ask", "start": 31.392999999999997, "end": 31.592999999999996}, {"text": "yourself", "start": 31.592999999999996, "end": 31.853}]}], "gaps": [], "maxgap": 0.3, "tempo": 1.08}